{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/shomea_qol_teruat_ammo"}}
{"text":"For Thou dost hear the sound of the Shofar and listen to Teruah and there is none like Thee. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who hearest the Teruah sound of His people Israel in compassion."}
